## 输入
```json
{
  "artifact": {{ artifact | tojson }},
  "artifact_payload": {{ artifact_payload | tojson }},
  "repair_targets": {{ repair_targets | default([]) | tojson }},
  "coherence_report": {{ coherence_report | tojson }},
  "repair_scope": {{ repair_scope | tojson }},
  "preserve": {{ preserve | tojson }},
  "change_intent": {{ change_intent | tojson }},
  "max_ops": {{ max_ops | tojson }}
}
```

